📖 Surah Al-Humazah

Makki Surah | Ayat: 9

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 1

وَيْلٌ لِكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُمَزَةٍ
Transliteration: Waylun likulli humazatil lumazah
Translation: Tabahi hai har us shakhs ke liye jo logon ko taana maarne wala aur burai karne wala hai.

🔎 Tafseer:

"Humazah" ka matlab hai woh shakhs jo saamne taana maar kar, logon ko zaleel karta hai.
"Lumazah" ka matlab hai woh jo peechhe baith kar logon ki burai karta hai (backbiting, gossip).

Is ayat mein Allah ne un logon ke liye sakht warning di jo doosron ki izzat uchhalte hain.
👉 Islam mein izzat insaan ka ek bara haq hai. Kisi ki peeth peeche baat karna (ghibat), mazaaq udhana, yaa zaleel karna — sab bade gunaah hain.

⚠️ Lesson:
Zaban se nikalne wale lafz hamesha soch samajh kar bolne chahiye. Zaban insaan ko jannat bhi dila sakti hai aur jahannam bhi.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 2

الَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُ
Transliteration: Alladhi jama‘a mālan wa ‘addadah
Translation: Jo maal ikattha karta hai aur usay baar-baar ginta hai.

🔎 Tafseer:

Yeh un logon ka zikr hai jo sirf paisa jama karne aur ginti karne mein lage rehte hain.
Inki zindagi ka asal maqsad sirf wealth hoti hai.
Aise log khud bhi use nahi kharch karte aur na hi Allah ke raaste mein dete hain.

⚠️ Lesson:
Maal Allah ki amanat hai. Usay sirf ginna aur ikattha karna gunaah hai, asal faida tab hai jab hum zakat, sadaqah aur gareebon ki madad karein.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 3

يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُ أَخْلَدَهُ
Transliteration: Yahsabu anna mālahu akhladah
Translation: Woh samajhta hai ke uska maal usko hamesha zinda rakhega.

🔎 Tafseer:

Insaan ka ghalat gumaan hota hai ke paisa usko security aur hamesha ki zindagi dega.
Lekin asal mein, paisa maut ko nahi rok sakta.
Aakhirat mein maal sirf tab kaam aayega jab woh Allah ke raaste mein kharch hua ho.

⚠️ Lesson:
Maal ko apna savior (najat dene wala) samajhna shirk ki soorat tak le ja sakta hai. Sirf Allah hi maut se bacha sakta hai aur akhirat mein najat de sakta hai.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 4

كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنبَذَنَّ فِي الْحُطَمَةِ
Transliteration: Kallā layunbadhanna fil-hutamah
Translation: Bilkul nahi! Usay zaroor Hutamah mein phenka jaayega.

🔎 Tafseer:

"Hutamah" Jahanam ki ek khaas aag hai jo sab kuch kuchal kar chura chura kar deti hai.
Yeh aag insaan ke sare abroo aur takabbur ko tod degi.

⚠️ Lesson:
Jo maal aur izzat ka ghamand karta hai, akhirat mein woh hi sab cheezein uske khilaf azaab banengi.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 5-6

وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا الْحُطَمَةُ ﴿٥﴾ نَارُ اللَّهِ الْمُوقَدَةُ ﴿٦﴾
Transliteration: Wamā adrāka mal-hutamah (5) Nāru-llāhil-mūqadah (6)
Translation: Tumhein kya maloom ke Hutamah kya hai? Yeh Allah ki bhadakti hui aag hai.

🔎 Tafseer:

Yeh aag duniya ki aag se alag hai.
Duniya ki aag insaan ke jism ko jalati hai, magar Hutamah dil tak jati hai.
"Nāru-llāh" ka matlab hai ek aisi aag jo Allah ne khud paida ki, jiska shiddat insaan samajh bhi nahi sakta.

⚠️ Lesson:
Aakhirat ki aag duniya ki aag se hazaron guna zyada shiddat wali hai.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 7

الَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى الْأَفْئِدَةِ
Transliteration: Allati tattali‘u ‘alal-af’idah
Translation: Jo dilon tak jaati hai.

🔎 Tafseer:

Yeh azaab sirf jism par nahi, balke insaan ke dil aur rooh tak pohanchta hai.
Iska matlab hai ke aag insaan ki niyyaton, buraayi aur takabbur ko bhi jala degi.

⚠️ Lesson:
Sirf amal nahi, dil ki niyyat bhi Allah ke nazdeek ahmiyat rakhti hai.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayat 8-9

إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ ﴿٨﴾ فِي عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ ﴿٩﴾
Transliteration: Innahā ‘alaihim mu’sadah (8) Fī ‘amadim mumaddadah (9)
Translation: Woh aag unpar bandh kar di jayegi, lambi lambi khambon mein.

🔎 Tafseer:

Gunahgar us aag mein aise qaid kiye jaayenge jaise qaidiyon ko lohay ke khambon se bandh diya jaata hai.
Na unke liye koi raasta hoga, na koi bachaane wala.
Ye azaab permanent hoga, koi relief nahi milegi.

⚠️ Lesson:
Jahanam sirf ek din ya ek saal ka azaab nahi, yeh abad (forever) azaab hai un logon ke liye jo iman se inkaar karke duniya ke maal aur takabbur mein lage rahe.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌸 Overall Lessons from Surah Al-Humazah

Gheebat, taana, aur mazaaq udaana – yeh sab gunaah hai jo akhirat mein azaab ka sabab banenge.
Maal ka ghamand – insaan ko dhoka deta hai. Mal Allah ke liye kharch karo warna yeh azaab ban jaayega.
Dil ki paakizgi – Allah sirf zahiri amal nahi dekhta, dil ki niyyat aur jazbaat bhi dekhta hai.
Aakhirat ki aag – duniya ki aag se bhi sakht hai, aur woh dil tak jalayegi.
Takabbur aur self-pride – sab kuch akhirat mein tod diya jaayega.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌿Daily Life Application

1️⃣ Zaban ki hifazat

Humesha soch samajh kar bolna.
Kisi ka mazaaq na udhao, taana na do.
Peeth peeche burai (gheebat) se bacho.

👉 Tip: Har roz apne aap se poochho – “Maine aaj kisi ki izzat ko nuqsaan to nahi pohanchaya?”

2️⃣ Maal ka sahi istemal

Paisa ikattha karna aur ginna apna shauk na banao.
Usay Allah ke raaste mein kharch karo (zakat, sadaqah, madad).
Maal ke ghamand ko dil se nikaal do.

👉 Tip: Har mahine ek chhoti si amount Allah ke liye donate karo.

3️⃣ Dil ko paak rakhna

Niyyat hamesha saaf raho.
Agar amal chhota bhi hai lekin niyyat achi hai, to Allah usay qabool karega.
Dilo mein bughz, hasad aur takabbur ko jaldi nikaal do.

👉 Tip: Har raat neend se pehle dua mein bolo:
"Ya Allah, mere dil ko bughz aur hasad se paak farma."

4️⃣ Takabbur se bachna

Apne maal, status ya knowledge par ghamand na karo.
Hamesha yaad rakho – sab kuch Allah ka diya hua hai, aur ek din chhin bhi sakta hai.

👉 Tip: Har kaam ke baad kaho “Alhamdulillah, sab Allah ki fazl se hai.”

5️⃣ Aakhirat ki yaad

Duniya ki aag se bhi sakht aag hai Jahanam ki.
Har galti par apne aap ko yaad dilao: “Kya main aakhirat ke liye tayyar hoon?”

👉 Tip: Din mein ek martaba 2 minute ke liye socho – “Agar aaj mera aakhri din ho, to kya main tayyar hoon Allah ke samne khara hone ke liye?”

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌸 Summary:
Surah Al-Humazah humein sikhati hai:
Doosron ki izzat karo
Maal ka ghamand mat karo,
Apne dil ko paak rakho,
Aakhirat ke azaab ko yaad rakh kar zindagi guzaaro.


